16-bit structural ALU, 1 model time unit per gate (not nanoseconds)
ADD  FFFF + 0 -> FFFF + 1 (carry through all 16 bits): last output change 43 units after the input change
ADD  0000 + 0 -> 0000 + 1 (no carry chain)         : last output change 17 units after the input change
SUB  0000 - 0 -> 0000 - 1 (borrow through all bits) : last output change 42 units after the input change
ADD -> XOR, operands fixed (opcode change only)     : last output change 3 units after the input change
XOR -> SUB, operands fixed (opcode change only)     : last output change 29 units after the input change
